# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Format: <from> <to> <status>

# Force the apex onto www (or delete this and do the reverse — pick one and
# be consistent, split hostnames cost you SEO).
https://nicolesteinmetz.com/*  https://www.nicolesteinmetz.com/:splat  301!

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UNBUILT ROUTES — holding pattern.
# Home, Pricing (and the five platform pages), Contact,
# How a build runs (/process/) and FAQs (/faqs/) are live.
# Privacy Policy, the platform decider, get-a-quote and
# start-a-project are not.
# 302, not 301: these URLs come back when the pages are signed off.
# python3 -m http.server does not honour this file — local preview still 404s.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/privacy/*            /  302
/platform-decider/    /  302
/get-a-quote/         /  302
/start-a-project/     /  302
